  <problem><title>Video review question</title>

  <p>Given the dynamical system <m>x_{t+1} = 4 + 0.6 x_t</m>, determine if <m>x_t = 5</m> or <m>x_t = 10</m> are equilibria.</p>

  <p>If <m>x_0 = 5</m>, then <m>x_1 = </m>
    <answer>7</answer>.  Therefore <m>x_t=5</m>
    <answer inline="true">
      <choice>is</choice>
      <choice credit="1">is not</choice>
    </answer>
    an equilibrium.</p>
    
  <p>If <m>x_0 = 10</m>, then <m>x_1 = </m>
    <answer>10</answer>.  Therefore <m>x_t=10</m>
    <answer inline="true">
      <choice credit="1">is</choice>
      <choice>is not</choice>
    </answer>
    an equilibrium.</p>
    
  </problem>
  
